  "solution": {
    "text": "There are 6 letters in the word BHARAT, 2 of them are identical. Hence total number of words $=6 ! / 2 !=360$<br />Number of words in which $B$ and $\\mathrm{H}$ come together<br />$=\\frac{5 ! 2 !}{2 !}=120$<br />final ans $=360-120=240$",
